      "widgets_values": [
        "integrated_multimodal_description: Vertical 9:16 flat 2D storytime horror. Solid flat fills only, extra thick uneven black ink contour, near-black navy / bone white / one muted teal. Red only for blood, infected eyes and the recording dot. Faces: two dot eyes, one short mouth line, no eyebrows, no nose, no lashes. Hands are mittens, no fingers. No gradient, no shading, no texture, no 3D, no realism, no text except the on-screen timer 00:00. [Shot 1] ui shot, camera slow push-in of about 3% over the shot. Flat solid fill. Black screen: a bone-white waveform travels across the lower third of a flat near-black navy field, a small red recording dot pulses above it, a bone-white timer in the top corner reads 00:00. At 00:00.000, the graphic is already in motion: the waveform travels and the recording dot pulses. At 00:00.600, The narrator says in an off-screen voiceover: <d>[Vietnamese] Nếu bạn nghe được đoạn ghi âm này... tên tôi là Khang.</d> At 00:03.500, the waveform amplitude changes and the dot keeps pulsing. At 00:07.700, the graphic settles without freezing, the dot still blinking. The recording dot keeps pulsing and the waveform keeps travelling across the black field, so no frame is frozen. Mood: u ám.\n\noverall_soundscape: A low aircraft engine hum and soft cabin ventilation continue underneath.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A",
